# =============================================================================
# NPM Registry Configuration for @apps/capacitor-monetplus-hce
# =============================================================================
#
# This file configures npm/pnpm to use Nimiq's self-hosted GitLab Package Registry.
#
# HOW TO USE:
# 1. Copy this file to your project root as `.npmrc`
# 2. Replace YOUR_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN with your GitLab token
#    (Create one at: https://scm.nim.team/-/user_settings/personal_access_tokens)
#    Required scopes: read_api, read_registry
#
# NOTE: Never commit your personal access token to version control!
# =============================================================================

# Registry for @apps scoped packages (project-specific)
@apps:registry=https://scm.nim.team/api/v4/projects/269/packages/npm/

# Authentication token (replace with your actual token)
//scm.nim.team/api/v4/projects/269/packages/npm/:_authToken=YOUR_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN